  /// data from the client by using the DNS tunnel without making a network
  /// connection to the client. DICTIONARY_DGA : Dictionary-based domain
  /// generation algorithms detection. Dictionary DGAs use wordlists to
  /// generate domains that appear more legitimate, making them harder to
  /// detect than traditional DGAs.
